msgid "Each pronoun has two forms. Say the short one, <0>ma</0>, and keep the long one, <1>mina</1>, for stress."
msgstr "Each pronoun has two forms. Say the short one, <0>ma</0>, and keep the long one, <1>mina</1>, for stress."

msgid "Each round gives a pronoun, <0/> and a word. Change <1>olema</1> to the form for that pronoun and write the sentence: <2>ma · olema · valmis</2> is <3/>."
msgstr "Each round gives a pronoun, <0/> and a word. Change <1>olema</1> to the form for that pronoun and write the sentence: <2>ma · olema · valmis</2> is <3/>."

