msgid "Estonian has six words for people, and each comes in a long and a short form that mean the same. <0/> and <1/> are both I. The short one, in colour below, is the one you’ll hear most. Tap any word."
msgstr "Estonian has six words for people, and each comes in a long and a short form that mean the same. <0/> and <1/> are both I. The short one, in colour below, is the one you’ll hear most. Tap any word."

